// NC32: F-3 alone. [corrected_code] with the four constants written as decimal literals (float32 in this Zorro build, gotchas 9d.1; the lint exemption below is scoped to this body). Per-instance state (no statics). (b) This control is what makes F-3 a checked fix: Fish moves by up to 1.288e-05 = 1.3e4 x the trace tolerance; v1 on the ramps is float32(.999) = 0.9990000128746033 (ramp_exact and bound fire).
